    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d526">

                <pb facs="0759" n="739" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg739"/>

                <head>Mr. Burnley to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-10-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 10, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 10th instant, enclosing copy of a letter from the Secretary
                    of the Navy, giving an explanation relative to the violation by federal cruisers
                    of the Halifax harbor regulations, and beg to state, in reply, that I have
                    forwarded a copy of that note to the lieutenant governor of Nova Scotia, who, I
                    am convinced will, receive the explanation given as entirely satisfactory.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. HUME BURNLEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c, &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
